    {
      "entry": 27975,
      "name": "Maiden of Grief",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:27975:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:dcfa1a5e97f6daa9fcc263b3",
            "source:683fad651eca9e03dd41ec45",
            "source:42cc80d062c963a1c3655e91",
            "source:1b5b825203b6e7d1dc9cd0b1"
          ],
          "text": "The Maiden of Grief is a hostile figure whose taunts turn to grief and regret. She warns intruders that they will die, speaks of her growing burden, and laments at death that she never wanted this.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 27975
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 27977,
      "name": "Krystallus",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:27977:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:d5a520d65dd956d5d46a8c5a",
            "source:be0f8452afd8135e06a504ca",
            "source:00096177ff40e141e910dafc",
            "source:f1bfcbd9eb7219330aedd981",
            "source:4b5aa55f850de17615d119af"
          ],
          "text": "Krystallus speaks in clipped threats—“Crush” and “Break… you…”—then gives a rough laugh after a kill and a drawn-out groan at death. His brief words portray a dangerous, blunt presence.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 27977
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 27978,
      "name": "Sjonnir The Ironshaper",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:27978:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:36dd3e6075246f68278dacfa",
            "source:1e7e06e3663dd0d3df2a4d96",
            "source:6ae935acf8bd8df6973dbbce",
            "source:915087da5711149e79b4fd1b",
            "source:88cdbba0fb2d2c6dad62d8e1"
          ],
          "text": "Sjonnir the Ironshaper condemns the curse of flesh, calling its victims fragile and declaring that flesh cannot match iron. He boasts that iron armies will smother the world; at death, he says Loken will not rest until the forge is retaken.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 27978
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
    {
      "entry": 28070,
      "name": "Brann Bronzebeard",
      "records": [
        {
          "authored": false,
          "id": "npc:28070:identity",
          "layer": "npc",
          "priority": 80,
          "sources": [
            "source:189023f6eeecbea2b3380498",
            "source:b7fd539b25ae2df55fe600ae",
            "source:9814293bb32d3e871b103b52",
            "source:fcc43912e9a8f0ebf6f6bf27",
            "source:5613a0e84f71b0fc0db2683f",
            "source:ce3a7dfff00c1308197d9e79"
          ],
          "text": "Brann is an eager researcher in the Halls of Stone, pressing for answers about the earthen’s origins, their anomalies, and the history of the dwarves. He works with adventurers through danger and intends to find and stop Loken, while trying to understand what he uncovers.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 28070
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": ""
    },
